{"4349540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Pillars of Pantheon","steam_appid":4349540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/0061095c834af892ffb18eb574718751.avif?t=1793744595\" width=740 height=205 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/05fa76975c37a59ddd60348dfc13d991.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pillars of Pantheon is a bullet-heaven “tower offense” roguelite. Build and customize the ultimate Roman siege tower by stacking marble blocks, ballistae, spears, shields, and mythical artifacts. Charge straight into overwhelming enemy hordes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/eb381e0479eca699bcb9498695e48b50.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of the Roman gods to unlock devastating abilities, summon allied minions, and reshape your siege tower into a moving engine of war.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps inspired by real Mediterranean locations, defeat iconic bosses, and face unforgiving challenges. Experiment with synergies, divine powers, and architectural creativity to survive the horrors of the underworld. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f5a97405fb17802b4544990b6ed7ded9.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pillar to your heart’s desire. Gain Venus’ favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/d383eaa1f605779d988303bc8d89c3fb.webp?t=1793744595\" width=650 height=38 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable building system featuring many unique blocks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman mythology-inspired environments and enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God-powered abilities that reshape combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression with high replayability.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand tall. Build with style. Or be reduced to rubble.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/0061095c834af892ffb18eb574718751.avif?t=1793744595\" width=740 height=205 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/7b999bc44653d1dc3d09f3aec332f2b3.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/05fa76975c37a59ddd60348dfc13d991.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pillars of Pantheon is a bullet-heaven “tower offense” roguelite. Build and customize the ultimate Roman siege tower by stacking marble blocks, ballistae, spears, shields, and mythical artifacts. Charge straight into overwhelming enemy hordes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/459fcc1eff083f03278d76175bb24311.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/eb381e0479eca699bcb9498695e48b50.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain the favor of the Roman gods to unlock devastating abilities, summon allied minions, and reshape your siege tower into a moving engine of war.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f62b8228ed66f664308c266304c3a446.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps inspired by real Mediterranean locations, defeat iconic bosses, and face unforgiving challenges. Experiment with synergies, divine powers, and architectural creativity to survive the horrors of the underworld. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/f5a97405fb17802b4544990b6ed7ded9.webp?t=1793744595\" width=643 height=54 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your pillar to your heart’s desire. Gain Venus’ favor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.poster.avif?t=1793744595\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.webm?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/428a099d7adc3a883f796c3ea76b95de.mp4?t=1793744595\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4349540\/extras\/d383eaa1f605779d988303bc8d89c3fb.webp?t=1793744595\" width=650 height=38 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable building system featuring many unique blocks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman mythology-inspired environments and enemies.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God-powered abilities that reshape combat.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression with high replayability.<\/p><\/li><li><